   "text": "New York Institute of Technology (NYIT) (Postgraduate) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nNew York Institute of Technology (NYIT) (Postgraduate)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nNew York Tech is emerging from recent challenges as a stronger, more future-focused university. As a dynamic, highly ranked, and accredited not-for-profit university, we're committed to educating the next generation of leaders, inspiring innovation, and advancing entrepreneurship.We understand a college degree is a serious investment and offer generous financial aid packages (99% of first-time, first-year students receive assistance). In addition to having one of the lowest out-of-pocket tuition costs among private colleges in New York State, we have special scholarships for veterans, transfer students, alumni, and children of police, firefighters, EMS, and K–12 teachers get a 50% discount on undergraduate tuition.By offering programs that meet market demands, our 100+ tech-focused degree programs and areas of specialization prepare students for jobs of the future, give them an edge in the marketplace, and help them grow as people, citizens, and professionals. Our nearly 8,000 students representing 72 countries and 40 states become engaged, technologically savvy physicians, architects, scientists, engineers, business leaders, digital artists, healthcare professionals, and more.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n31/03/2026 04:58\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n31/03/2026 04:58\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$46,200.00\nMin: US$41,960.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n16%\n1,233 of 7,711 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1995\nCampus(es)\nLong Island, New York\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n19/03/2026\nContract End Date\n18/03/2028\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.nyit.edu/nyc/housing\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.nyit.edu/admissions/nyit_scholarships\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CzyyNn_9_0c\nInternship Details\nhttps://www.nyit.edu/career_services/internships\nAdditional Information\nApplication Fee - USD 50",
